==English==
===Noun phrase===
# {{idiom}} {{vulgar}} A roundabout, nonsensical story. Also called a Banbury tale. Originated from Oscar Wilde's play, "The Importance of Being Ernest."
====Translations====
*Catalan: una [[història]] sense [[cap]] ni peus (''a story wihtout head or feet'')
*Russian: [[сказка про белого бычка]] (''tale of the white bull''), [[бред сивой кобылы]] (''rave of the grey mare'')